<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Supplemental experiments ‣ Latent learning: episodic memory complements parametric learning by enabling flexible reuse of experiences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Ablating sequence length and batch size on the gridworld BC tasks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
